+- [ ] Obtain the native Airfone and mobile carrier rows, field definitions, timestamps, operator route/transfer data, and United's contemporaneous notes. Match by call key before comparing clock values or drawing conclusions from short or zero durations. [Prior maintenance-record comparison](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/tree/main/investigation/broader-evidence/telephone-ua93-starfix-maintenance-2026-11-06)
+- [ ] Retain the distinct AA77 zero-duration exhibit, carrier/operator source, Keyton interview and September 20 usage report as open dependencies. This study examined the UA93 presentation and selected source comparators.
+
+Read the relevant testimony, exhibit offer, transcript certification and exhibit index, and OCR'd Part A PDF pp. 1–12 with visual checks on the cover and the 9:32 paragraph. Checked the exact words and locators against the recovered bodies. The court docket was read through the public web reader. The session copy's full correspondence to the court versions, recorded call audio, native connection fields and independent caller-to-row joins remain untested. Access dates, bytes and SHA-256 are in [SOURCE-PINS.json](SOURCE-PINS.json).
